{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_39790398","title":"Find the Professor","entry":"Dlg_39790398::entry","exit":"Dlg_39790398::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_741250B3","articyId":"72057697117172076","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Professor Kasey Remo","text":"Well, you have the look of an inquisitor.","speakerId":"Ntt_137D526B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well, you have the look of an inquisitor.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":-475.0,"y":825.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31316","byteOffset":19727296,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_4F0AA680","articyId":"72057778721523878","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Professor Kasey Remo","text":"An inquisitor: someone making an inquiry. One who is searching for something.","speakerId":"Ntt_137D526B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"An inquisitor: someone making an inquiry. One who is searching for something.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":125.0,"y":950.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37624","byteOffset":28572160,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_4F3DDE75","articyId":"72057778721523887","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Professor Kasey Remo","text":"When you spend as much time attempting to educate the populace, that tends to become a natural ability.","speakerId":"Ntt_137D526B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"When you spend as much time attempting to educate the populace, that tends to become a natural ability.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":725.0,"y":825.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45618","byteOffset":31589744,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_FB4B9CA0","articyId":"72057778721523894","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Professor Kasey Remo","text":"That is what an inquisitor is meant to do. Please, ask away.","speakerId":"Ntt_137D526B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That is what an inquisitor is meant to do. Please, ask away.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":125.0,"y":1200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29660","byteOffset":19102368,"byteLength":368}},{"id":"DFr_410F6E1D","articyId":"72057778721523909","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Professor Kasey Remo","text":"The original AG? Of course. I might teach history, specifically digital disembodiment, but I'd be ashamed if I had never heard of such a soul.","speakerId":"Ntt_137D526B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The original AG? Of course. I might teach history, specifically digital disembodiment, but I'd be ashamed if I had never heard of such a soul.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1350.0,"y":825.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41873","byteOffset":30169000,"byteLength":524}},{"id":"DFr_510E2499","articyId":"72057778721523937","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Professor Kasey Remo","text":"Oh, yes! That's this theory surrounding several multi-faceted ideas about digital... why were you asking about the original AG?","speakerId":"Ntt_137D526B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Oh, yes! That's this theory surrounding several multi-faceted ideas about digital... why were you asking about the original AG?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":1950.0,"y":1050.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47837","byteOffset":32432216,"byteLength":436}},{"id":"DFr_BA061BF4","articyId":"72057778721523945","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Professor Kasey Remo","text":"Ah, well one certainty in life is that there are so many things for us all to learn. The treasure trove of knowledge is endless! Why do you ask about them?","speakerId":"Ntt_137D526B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ah, well one certainty in life is that there are so many things for us all to learn. The treasure trove of knowledge is endless! Why do you ask about them?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":1950.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20875","byteOffset":15779816,"byteLength":464}},{"id":"DFr_93AE1E69","articyId":"72057778721523953","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Professor Kasey Remo","text":"Ah, the artist's compendium. The mark of a true creative. If that's what you're looking for then I would recommend turning your inquisition toward the appropriate Sec division.","speakerId":"Ntt_137D526B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ah, the artist's compendium. The mark of a true creative. If that's what you're looking for then I would recommend turning your inquisition toward the appropriate Sec division.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2575.0,"y":825.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25118","byteOffset":17384568,"byteLength":520}},{"id":"DFr_8778E1B2","articyId":"72057778721523974","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Professor Kasey Remo","text":"My university! I wish. If it were, I'd give it the funding and resources it needs. But the powers that be see differently.","speakerId":"Ntt_137D526B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"My university! I wish. If it were, I'd give it the funding and resources it needs. But the powers that be see differently.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":3150.0,"y":950.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31575","byteOffset":19826920,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_33A5F8AB","articyId":"72057778721523989","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Professor Kasey Remo","text":"When you can find what you want in the Nets why attend a lecture and learn?","speakerId":"Ntt_137D526B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"When you can find what you want in the Nets why attend a lecture and learn?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":3725.0,"y":950.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42114","byteOffset":30258976,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_9687BC2A","articyId":"72057778721524009","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Professor Kasey Remo","text":"As much as I'd love to have the paradigm shift, as long as people are consuming knowledge and not mindless drivel, I sleep soundly at night.","speakerId":"Ntt_137D526B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"As much as I'd love to have the paradigm shift, as long as people are consuming knowledge and not mindless drivel, I sleep soundly at night.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":4325.0,"y":950.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25848","byteOffset":17661704,"byteLength":448}},{"id":"DFr_A756E512","articyId":"72057778721524023","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Professor Kasey Remo","text":"Those who seek knowledge shall find themselves in the search. Best of luck.","speakerId":"Ntt_137D526B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Those who seek knowledge shall find themselves in the search. Best of luck.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":5100.0,"y":825.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29454","byteOffset":19021568,"byteLength":448}},{"id":"DFr_BC635EFC","articyId":"72057821671325782","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Professor Kasey Remo","text":"Nice to meet you again.","speakerId":"Ntt_137D526B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Nice to meet you again.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":725.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18869","byteOffset":15025600,"byteLength":332}},{"id":"DFr_50E4F659","articyId":"72057697117172081","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"A what?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"A what?","TextSheVersion":"A what?","TextTheyVersion":"A what?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":-175.0,"y":950.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30847","byteOffset":19551264,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_994FEEF8","articyId":"72057778721523857","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You're pretty perceptive.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You're pretty perceptive.","TextSheVersion":"You're pretty perceptive.","TextTheyVersion":"You're pretty perceptive."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":425.0,"y":825.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25255","by